From 1e317012bf16c0fa7610c08a700d288021a07de6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jefferson-Butler1 <jefferson.butler@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:58:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web,mobile): order the inbox oldest first
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Working section's time-ordered inbox always put the latest return on
top, so threads waiting longest sank to the bottom. An Inbox order setting
(web Settings → General, mobile Settings → Threads → Beta) can now list
them oldest first, working the inbox as a queue.
